# Playwright MCP session artifacts (screenshots/logs from ad-hoc QA)
.playwright-mcp/

# Visual-QA sweep screenshots are REGENERABLE (tests/visual/sweep.mjs) and cost
# ~100MB a round, so only the reports they produce are tracked. Everything a
# reviewer needs to judge a run — pass/fail, h1 count, console + request errors,
# horizontal overflow, missing alt — lives in report.json / summary.json.
# Non-regenerable evidence (the client's annotated review images in
# QA/qa-10092026/, the icon-parity crops CLAUDE.md cites) is NOT covered here
# and stays tracked.
QA/after*/**/*.png
QA/baseline/**/*.png
QA/supervisor-review/**/*.png
QA/graphics-parity-final/**/*.png
